ait for the  next video to drop feel free to check  out my growing attack on titan playlist  where i got videos about the titan  shifters  the ackermans and much more link to that  is in the description  and i especially want to thank the  patron squad over on patreon and here on  youtube who helped make videos like this  one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  patron of legend the one acknowledged by  lord wigo himself  and the most donated champion of the  world alpha sigma  and are the one tier patrons the ones  who stand atop all clans  in grata acquire respect pate heffa liam  thompson  al-jatal dr cortman dustin scarlett  the toasted chi bang emperor otaku  spidey life tinel  baked buddhist tungsten tarkis and yuno  and are pro hero tier patrons the one  and only gilgamesh steelers angel cruz  anatoly kazowski cricket xp  retuain de aura very gucci alicia actor  bonnie parks hinokami and water joanne  garcia the red haired raven ted note 10  i sparky 65 fat boy games deadly saint  and soul rise slice and dice  thank you all so much if you do enjoy  our work you can support mormon by going  over to patreon.com  animeoutpro and becoming a patron today  for as little as one dollar  if you do so you'll get your name  featured in future videos alongside  these amazing people right here  and you'll even get access to our  private patron only discord where we  talk about anime life and of course  thank memes so check out patreon.com  anime upload link to that is in the  description  if you're interested you can also join  the youtube channel by clicking that  blue join button next to the subscribe  button that you've hopefully  already destroyed so yeah you can  support more content now if you prefer  whichever way you support us you can get  the same great benefits  thanks again and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

